OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours raise fears of 'drunken
OL,4,Acarousing' at distillery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA string of objections have been lodged
OL,7,Fto an application for a new alcohol
OL,8,Flicence at a converted school building
OL,9,Fin the south of Scotland.
OL,11,FThe Dark Art Distillery at the former
OL,12,FJohnston Primary in Kirkcudbright has
OL,13,Foperated since 2021 using 14-day
OL,14,Foccasional licences but it now wants
OL,15,Fpermanent permission to sell drink on
OL,16,Fsite until midnight or 01:00 for
OL,17,Fspecial functions.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
