OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours raise fears of 'drunken
OL,4,Acarousing' at distillery
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople nearby - including at the
OL,7,Fplanetarium in the same building - have
OL,8,Fobjected, with one citing the risk of
OL,9,F"drunken adults carousing until
OL,10,Fmidnight and beyond".
OL,12,FThe licensing board's standards officer
OL,13,Fsaid the premises had been in operation
OL,14,Fsince 2021 without issues or concerns
OL,15,Fand she had "no adverse comments to
OL,16,Fmake".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
